  "body": "This is a normative change that defines the proper behaviors of\r\nimage file serialization APIs in the event of an encoder error.\r\nFor toDataURL, the behavior is to return the string \"data:,\". For\r\ntoBlob, the behavior is to invoke the callback with null. For\r\nOffscreenCanvas.convertToBlob, the behavior is to reject the\r\npromise with and EncodingError exception.",
